{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-25T01:52:13.269Z","author":"codex-agent","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"codex","agent_model":"gpt-6.1-sol","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"102437eb496e77272e6575a5","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"gpt-6.1-sol","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"high","source":"probe"},"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/1","value":{"created_at":"2026-10-25T01:52:13.269Z","author":"codex-agent","text":"Implemented typed stateless SDK and context-next-evidence CLI using SDK expected errors, stable packet reads and lossless table-cell encoding. Exact optimizer bounded to 12 criteria/64 reads; source revision contracts cover the full catalog and estimates; JSON saved-plan check rejects changes. Targeted planner tests passed 6/6, including 500 seeded sequences (2000 operations), full SDK-native state read-back with relationships, installed CLI with no Git, and five peer-transition boundaries. Registration/renderer integration passed 59/59. Public main snapshot validation: 91 items, 31 with criteria/tests, six selected items, seven missing criteria, three reads, one selected read, six covered/one uncovered; 523 estimated tokens + one call at 40 overhead = 563 vs 915 for the pair; JSON 869 bytes, TOON 912 bytes. Zero acquired reads and unchanged tracker fingerprint. Behavioral reverts rebuilt: greedy cover fails the three-read optimum fixture; bypassed revision refusal fails stale-plan tests. Restored before verification. Full release gates delegated to CI per the shared-host instruction."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-25T01:52:13.269Z"}],"before_hash":"6a824981ed29922676d9ae718eedb158ffdcd1d536208721389a66171364e520","after_hash":"1f99b2fdc78ae76b2505e8ad0f59a4a023209e048b10a169440b246d338a59de","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_